ne pedibus non stet ebria Musa suis.<ref>Quoted in Magnús Snædal, '[https://www.academia.edu/758303 The "Vandal" Epigram]', in ''Filologia Germanica/Germanic Philology'', 1 (2009), 181–213 (pp. 183–84).</ref>}}
