Other surviving Vandalic words are {{lang|xvn|Baudus}}, "master" <ref>Anthologia Latina No. 307, I. 5</ref> and {{lang|xvn|Vandalirice}}, "King of the Vandals".<ref>Anthologia Latina No. 215, 523–543</ref>

